Maintainer: Kuo Wang <wangkuo@nifty.com>
Description: Provides functions to fit speed-accuracy psychometric models
    for binomial count outcome data. The models jointly represent accuracy
    and response time and can be used for model-based calibration and scoring
    of oral reading fluency (ORF) assessment data. The methods are based on
    Potgieter, Kamata and Kara (2017) <https://arxiv.org/abs/1705.10446>
    and Kara, Kamata, Potgieter and Nese (2020)
    <doi:10.1177/0013164419900208>. 
